# Rakdos Signet: "{1}, {T}: Add {B}{R}." (CR 605.1a, a mana ability with mana in its own cost, CR 602.2b).
# Cast with two Mountains on turn 3. On turn 5 two Mountains tapped for {R}{R}, the ability's {1} paid from that pool, and
# the Signet adds {B}{R}: the pool is exactly {R}{R}{B}, so a free ability would leave {R}{R}{R}{B} and an ability adding one
# color would leave no {B}. Grim Repriser costs {B}{R} and is cast from that pool, proving both mana are the colors printed.
# Green is refused beside the black and red the ability does add (the plain activation is the positive control), and a
# tapped Signet is not offered a second time.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mountain x3
Rakdos Signet
Grim Repriser
Mountain x12

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x16

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mountain.Play
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Mountain.Play
Bot1.Battlefield.Mountain#1.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mountain#2.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Rakdos Signet.Cast
[T5 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Mountain.Play
Bot1.Battlefield.Mountain#1.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mountain#2.Activate
? Bot1.Mana = {R}{R}
! Bot1.Battlefield.Rakdos Signet.Activate(Color: Green)
Bot1.Battlefield.Rakdos Signet.Activate
Bot1.Choose(Close mana window)
Bot1.Choose(Pay mana)
? Bot1.Mana = {B}{R}{R}
! Bot1.Battlefield.Rakdos Signet.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Grim Repriser.Cast
Bot1.Choose(Close mana window)
? Bot1.Mana = {R}

[Expect]
Turn = 5
Bot1.Battlefield.Rakdos Signet.Tapped = true
Bot1.Battlefield.Grim Repriser.Subtypes = Bard; Zombie
Bot1.Life = 20
